        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster} casts one of the following spells, requiring no Material components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC [[lookup @attributes.spell.dc]]):</p><p><strong>At Will:</strong> <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMageArmor0]{Mage Armor}</em> (included in AC), <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMageHand00]{Mage Hand}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplMinorIllus]{Minor Illusion}</em></p><p><strong>1/Day Each:</strong> <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBefuddleme]{Befuddlement}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDetectThou]{Detect Thoughts}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFly0000000]{Fly}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScrying000]{Scrying}</em>, <em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplShatter000]{Shatter}</em> (level 7 version)</p>",
